{"id":"n4-005","title":"い-Adjective く する/なる","romaji":"i-Adjective kusuru/naru","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Express a change happening or making something change.","longExplanation":"The い-Adjective く する/なる grammar point is used to indicate a change happening (naru) or intentionally making something change (suru). When using this grammatical structure, the い-adjective is changed to its く form, and then is followed by either する (to make the change) or なる (the change happens).","formation":"い-Adjective (remove い) + く + する/なる","examples":[{"jp":"部屋を明るくします。","romaji":"Heya o akaruku shimasu.","en":"I will make the room brighter.","words":[{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"明るく","vocabId":"1532350","reading":"あかるい","baseForm":"明るい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3]},{"jp":"彼の顔は赤くなりました。","romaji":"Kare no kao wa akaku narimashita.","en":"His face turned red.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"顔","vocabId":"1217730","reading":"かお"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"赤く","vocabId":"1383240","reading":"あかい","baseForm":"赤い"},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"この料理を辛くしてください。","romaji":"Kono ryouri o karaku shite kudasai.","en":"Please make this dish spicy.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"辛く","vocabId":"1365860","reading":"つらい","baseForm":"辛い"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":